  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Peace and Stability in Iraq (BPSI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to advancing DS for IDPs that remain in displacement, particularly those experiencing social cohesion-related barriers, IOM proposes a collaborative effort with the IRC. This approach will complement IRC&#x2019;s FCDO-funded project contributing to building peace and stability in Iraq, structured on a social cohesion pathway (including constructive dialogue and community engagement) and on removal of barriers pathway (strengthening access to justice and legal assistance).</narrative>
  </description>
